      <h1 class="jr-h1">Collagen for Gut Health: Is It Good for Bloating and Leaky Gut?</h1>
      <p class="jr-standfirst">Collagen is sold for bloating, gut repair and leaky gut on the strength of one small study almost nobody selling it has read. This article tells you what that study did, what the one randomised trial of the gut barrier found, and what is likelier to be behind your bloating.</p>

